{"seq":1,"slug":"ble-phy-link-layer-channel-hopping","title":"BLE 物理层与链路层：信道划分、跳频与空口时隙建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-ble-bluetooth-nfc-connectivity-engineering/ble-stack-gatt-data-model/ble-phy-link-layer-channel-hopping","wordCount":2904,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"ble-物理层与链路层-信道划分-跳频与空口时隙建模\">BLE 物理层与链路层：信道划分、跳频与空口时隙建模</h1><p>跨境电商移动端接入自研蓝牙配件——扫码枪、电子价签、冷链温度标签——时，线上问题几乎全部先落在物理层与链路层：为什么同款硬件在深圳仓库好用、到吉隆坡仓库就频繁断连；为什么 2M PHY 标称 2 Mbps，应用层实测却到不了 300 kbps。回答这些问题不能停在 CoreBluetooth / Android BLE 的 API 层，必须下探到 2.4 GHz 空口：信道怎么分、跳频怎么算、一个连接事件里时间怎么被切掉。本文把 BLE（Bluetooth Low Energy）的 PHY 与 Link Layer 拆成可量化、可建模的模块，公式与参数可直接用于估算吞吐和时延预算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从-2-4-ghz-空口到一条连接的时间轴\">核心概念：从 2.4 GHz 空口到一条连接的时间轴</h2><p>BLE 工作在 2.4 GHz ISM 频段，占用 2402 MHz 到 2480 MHz，按 <strong>2 MHz 间隔切成 40 个信道</strong>（Bluetooth Core Specification Vol 6 Part A，<a href=\"https://www.bluetooth.com/specifications/specs/\">bluetooth.com</a>）。中心频率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2402</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mtext> MHz</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>39</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_k = 2402 + 2k \\ \\text{MHz}, \\quad k = 0,1,\\dots,39</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2402</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MHz</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">39</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 37 个是数据信道，3 个是广播信道。物理层调制统一使用 <strong>GFSK（高斯频移键控）</strong>，但速率与抗噪能力由所选 PHY 决定：LE 1M 用 1 Msym/s、2M 用 2 Msym/s、LE Coded 通过前向纠错把同一比特扩展成多个符号换取更远距离。链路层把这些比特组织成<strong>连接事件（connection event）</strong>：主从在每个事件里按约定信道、以锚点时刻对齐，交换若干数据包后跳到下一信道。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[应用层 GATT/BLE] --&gt; B[L2CAP + ATT]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Link Layer&lt;br/&gt;连接事件 / 跳频 / ACK]&#10;    C --&gt; D{PHY 选择}&#10;    D --&gt;|LE 1M| E[1 Msym/s&lt;br/&gt;~1 Mbps 原始]&#10;    D --&gt;|LE 2M| F[2 Msym/s&lt;br/&gt;~2 Mbps 原始]&#10;    D --&gt;|LE Coded| G[S=2 或 S=8&lt;br/&gt;125-500 kbps 远距]&#10;    E --&gt; H[40 x 2 MHz 信道&lt;br/&gt;3 广播 + 37 数据]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[CSA#1 / CSA#2 跳频&lt;br/&gt;规避 Wi-Fi 干扰]\">graph TD\n    A[应用层 GATT/BLE] --&gt; B[L2CAP + ATT]\n    B --&gt; C[Link Layer&lt;br/&gt;连接事件 / 跳频 / ACK]\n    C --&gt; D{PHY 选择}\n    D --&gt;|LE 1M| E[1 Msym/s&lt;br/&gt;~1 Mbps 原始]\n    D --&gt;|LE 2M| F[2 Msym/s&lt;br/&gt;~2 Mbps 原始]\n    D --&gt;|LE Coded| G[S=2 或 S=8&lt;br/&gt;125-500 kbps 远距]\n    E --&gt; H[40 x 2 MHz 信道&lt;br/&gt;3 广播 + 37 数据]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[CSA#1 / CSA#2 跳频&lt;br/&gt;规避 Wi-Fi 干扰]</pre><p>理解这张图的关键，是分清<strong>每一层各自贡献了多少开销</strong>。PHY 决定比特率，链路层决定每个连接事件能塞进多少包、包之间必须留多少静默间隔，应用层再叠加 ATT/GATT 协议头。下表把四个 PHY 变体的关键参数并排，这是所有吞吐估算的起点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>PHY</th>\n<th>调制 / 符号率</th>\n<th>原始比特率</th>\n<th>每比特占用时间</th>\n<th>抗噪定位</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LE 1M</td>\n<td>GFSK, 1 Msym/s</td>\n<td>1 Mbps</td>\n<td>1 µs</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>默认、兼容性最好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LE 2M</td>\n<td>GFSK, 2 Msym/s</td>\n<td>2 Mbps</td>\n<td>0.5 µs</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>大包传输、OTA、文件同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LE Coded S=2</td>\n<td>GFSK + FEC</td>\n<td>500 kbps</td>\n<td>2 µs</td>\n<td>约 +4 dB 增益</td>\n<td>中距、稍高可靠性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LE Coded S=8</td>\n<td>GFSK + FEC</td>\n<td>125 kbps</td>\n<td>8 µs</td>\n<td>约 +12 dB 增益</td>\n<td>远距、低速率传感器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>需要建立的第一直觉：<strong>标称比特率不是净荷速率，更不是应用层吞吐</strong>。2M PHY 的 2 Mbps 是符号层数字，扣掉前导、接入地址、头部、CRC、帧间间隔与往返 ACK 后，应用层实测通常只有标称值的 <strong>30%–70%</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信道划分-3-个广播信道与-37-个数据信道\">信道划分：3 个广播信道与 37 个数据信道</h2><p>BLE 的 40 个信道分工在物理上就被固定。三个<strong>广播信道</strong>是 37、38、39 号，中心频率 2402、2426、2480 MHz；它们刻意放在频段两端与中点：Wi-Fi 主用信道 1/6/11 位于 2412/2437/2462 MHz，把广播信道放进这些峰值之间的缝隙，能让&quot;设备发现&quot;在嘈杂的办公或仓库环境下仍有机会被听到。其余 37 个（0–36 号）是<strong>数据信道</strong>，连接建立后所有数据都在这些信道上跳。</p>\n<p>广播有三种信道机制：<strong>legacy advertising</strong> 只用 37/38/39，是 BLE 4.x–5.0 时代的唯一选择；<strong>extended advertising</strong>（BLE 5.0 起）允许广播出现在任意数据信道，把单包载荷从 31 字节扩到 254 字节并支持分片链式广播；<strong>periodic advertising</strong> 提供可被多设备同步接收的周期广播流，是 AoA/AoD 测向与部分电子价签方案的底座。</p>\n<p>数据信道还有&quot;好信道 / 坏信道&quot;的动态概念。链路层维护一个 <strong>channel map（信道图）</strong>，最多 37 位，标记每个数据信道是否可用。主机可基于本地 Wi-Fi 干扰探测把被占用信道标为坏信道并下发给控制器，控制器跳频时只从&quot;好信道&quot;集合里选，规范要求好信道<strong>至少保留 2 个</strong>，否则连接无法维持。跨境部署的常见故障就出在这里：一套在中国仓库调好的 channel map 直接搬到 Wi-Fi 信道不同的海外仓库，好信道集合恰好落进当地干扰区，连接质量立刻下降——channel map 必须随现场射频环境重算。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信道类别</th>\n<th>编号</th>\n<th>中心频率</th>\n<th>数量</th>\n<th>何时使用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>广播信道</td>\n<td>37 / 38 / 39</td>\n<td>2402 / 2426 / 2480 MHz</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>设备发现、连接建立、legacy 广播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据信道</td>\n<td>0–36</td>\n<td>2404–2478 MHz 偶数对齐</td>\n<td>37</td>\n<td>连接后的全部数据交换与跳频</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个易错细节：CSA 算法里所有取模都按 <strong>37 个数据信道</strong>而非 40 来算——广播信道的编号不参与跳频退化序列，混淆这一点会写出错误的跳频实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跳频与信道选择算法-csa-1-与-csa-2\">跳频与信道选择算法：CSA#1 与 CSA#2</h2><p>BLE 的跳频不是固定序列，而是由链路层按**信道选择算法（Channel Selection Algorithm）**在每个连接事件开始时算出下一个信道。算法有两个版本。</p>\n<p><strong>CSA#1</strong> 是 BLE 4.x 时代的算法，规则简单：每个连接事件后，未映射信道由上一次的信道加上一个<strong>跳频增量（hopIncrement，5–16 之间的整数）</strong>，再对 37 取模：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>unmappedChannel</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>lastUnmappedChannel</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>hopIncrement</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>37</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{unmappedChannel} = (\\text{lastUnmappedChannel} + \\text{hopIncrement}) \\bmod 37</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">unmappedChannel</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lastUnmappedChannel</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hopIncrement</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若算出的信道在 channel map 中是坏信道，则在&quot;好信道有序集合&quot;里按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>remappingIndex</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>unmappedChannel</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>numUsedGoodChannels</mtext></mrow><mn>37</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{remappingIndex} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{\\text{unmappedChannel} \\cdot \\text{numUsedGoodChannels}}{37} \\right\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">remappingIndex</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">37</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unmappedChannel</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">numUsedGoodChannels</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 重新取一个。</p>\n<p><strong>CSA#2</strong> 是 BLE 5.0 引入的算法，目的正是修复 CSA#1 在坏信道较多时跳频分布不均、易被预测的问题。它不再用简单加法，而是分三步：先由每个连接事件的 <strong>channelIdentifier</strong>（随事件递增、与访问地址相关的 16 位值）做异或折叠，再乘性置换，最后偏移：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>prn_e</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>chId</mtext><mo>⊕</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>chId</mtext><mo>≫</mo><mn>16</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>perm</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>prn_e</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>37</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{prn\\_e} = \\text{chId} \\oplus (\\text{chId} \\gg 16), \\qquad \\text{perm} = \\text{prn\\_e} \\bmod 37</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7406em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prn_e</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">chId</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">chId</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">perm</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prn_e</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>permuted</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>perm</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mn>17</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>37</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>unmappedChannel</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>permuted</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>37</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{permuted} = \\text{perm} \\cdot 17 \\bmod 37, \\qquad \\text{unmappedChannel} = (\\text{permuted} + 1) \\bmod 37</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">permuted</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">perm</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">17</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">unmappedChannel</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">permuted</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>重映射思想与 CSA#1 一致，只是索引不同。</p>\n<p>CSA#2 的置换因子 17 与模数 37 互质，保证遍历均匀；加上 channelIdentifier 依赖访问地址，不同设备跳频序列互不相同，抗同道干扰与抗预测能力明显更强。<strong>BLE 5.0 及以后的所有连接默认使用 CSA#2</strong>，但规范要求同时支持两者——连接一方是 4.x 老设备时链路会回落到 CSA#1，这是混合设备群跳频质量参差的根因。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[连接事件开始] --&gt; B[更新 channelIdentifier]&#10;    B --&gt; C{协商版本}&#10;    C --&gt;|BLE 4.x| D[CSA#1&lt;br/&gt;last + hopIncrement mod 37]&#10;    C --&gt;|BLE 5.0+| E[CSA#2&lt;br/&gt;异或折叠 + 乘17置换]&#10;    D --&gt; F[得到 unmappedChannel]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G{是好信道?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[本事件使用该信道]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[按 remappingIndex&lt;br/&gt;在好信道集合中重映射]&#10;    I --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; J[事件结束&lt;br/&gt;事件计数 +1]&#10;    J --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n    A[连接事件开始] --&gt; B[更新 channelIdentifier]\n    B --&gt; C{协商版本}\n    C --&gt;|BLE 4.x| D[CSA#1&lt;br/&gt;last + hopIncrement mod 37]\n    C --&gt;|BLE 5.0+| E[CSA#2&lt;br/&gt;异或折叠 + 乘17置换]\n    D --&gt; F[得到 unmappedChannel]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G{是好信道?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[本事件使用该信道]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[按 remappingIndex&lt;br/&gt;在好信道集合中重映射]\n    I --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; J[事件结束&lt;br/&gt;事件计数 +1]\n    J --&gt; A</pre><p>工程上要记住一条：<strong>跳频序列由控制器内部计算，应用无法直接指定&quot;用哪个信道&quot;</strong>，能干预的只有 channel map。所以排查&quot;某频段被干扰&quot;的正确姿势是更新 channel map，而不是试图在代码里锁信道——API 层根本不提供这个入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"空口时隙建模-连接事件-窗口与吞吐上限\">空口时隙建模：连接事件、窗口与吞吐上限</h2><p>把时间轴放大到连接事件内部，才能理解为什么实际吞吐远低于标称。一次事件里，主设备先在锚点（anchor point）时刻发包，从设备收到后经固定 <strong>T_IFS = 150 µs</strong> 的帧间间隔回应；&quot;主发从收 + 从发主收&quot;算一个往返。**连接间隔（connInterval）**是两个锚点之间的时间，范围 <strong>7.5 ms 到 4 s、步进 1.25 ms</strong>；iOS 与 Android 各有策略限制，实际 API 申请值会被系统改写。</p>\n<p>空口占用时间可用比特直接算。以 LE 1M 为例，一个数据包为：前导 1 字节 + 接入地址 4 字节 + PDU 头 2 字节 + 载荷（2–257 字节，DLE 后有效载荷至 251 字节）+ 可选 MIC 4 字节（加密时）+ CRC 3 字节。发一个载荷 L 字节的包，空口时间约为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>未加密</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{1M}(L) = (1 + 4 + 2 + L + 3) \\times 8\\ \\mu s \\quad (\\text{未加密}), \\qquad T_{2M}(L) = \\frac{(2 + 4 + 2 + L + 3) \\times 8}{2}\\ \\mu s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">未加密</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意 <strong>2M PHY 的前导是 2 字节而非 1 字节</strong>——速率翻倍但每次都要多花一个字节的前导，这是小包场景下 2M 收益被削弱的直接原因。代入 L=251：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.12</mn><mtext> ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{1M} \\approx 2.12\\ \\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.12</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.06</mn><mtext> ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{2M} \\approx 1.06\\ \\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.06</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>连接事件容量受三件事限制：单事件能塞的包数、每包的往返间隔、有效载荷占比。默认 BLE 的 <strong>ATT MTU 为 23 字节</strong>，扣掉 ATT 操作码 1 字节与句柄 2 字节，单包有效载荷只有 20 字节；在 1M PHY 下光空口就吃掉 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>240</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(10+20)\\times 8 = 240\\ \\mu s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">240</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，加上头部与 T_IFS，应用层净吞吐往往落到 <strong>100–250 kbps</strong>。把 MTU 协商到 247、启用 DLE、再用 2M PHY，净吞吐才能爬到 <strong>1 Mbps 上下</strong>——这是 2M &quot;标称 2 Mbps、实测约 1.4 Mbps 上限&quot;说法的来源。</p>\n<p>连接建立的<strong>窗口机制</strong>同样要建模。从设备无法知道主设备的精确时钟，只能靠接收<strong>窗口（window）<strong>覆盖漂移：主设备在连接请求里给出 <code>winOffset</code> 与 <code>winSize</code>，从设备在预期锚点前后打开窗口。两侧睡眠时钟精度不同会让窗口随连接生命周期</strong>累积加宽（window widening）</strong>，量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>connInterval</mtext><mo>×</mo><mo>∑</mo><mtext>SCA</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{connInterval} \\times \\sum \\text{SCA}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">connInterval</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SCA</span></span></span></span></span></span>。SCA 是睡眠时钟精度（ppm）；低精度晶振（如 500 ppm）在长连接间隔下会让窗口迅速膨胀，吃掉本可用于收发的时隙，表现为&quot;连接越久越费电、越容易丢包&quot;。这正是<strong>低成本配件长连接后性能退化</strong>的物理原因，而非软件 bug。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>取值/范围</th>\n<th>对吞吐或时延的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>connInterval</td>\n<td>7.5 ms – 4 s，步进 1.25 ms</td>\n<td>越小越实时、越费电；越大越省电、延迟越高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T_IFS</td>\n<td>固定 150 µs</td>\n<td>每个往返固定开销，无法压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ATT MTU</td>\n<td>默认 23，可协商至 517</td>\n<td>直接决定单包有效载荷占比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DLE（数据长度扩展）</td>\n<td>有效载荷可至 251 字节</td>\n<td>减少分包数、提升净荷效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>睡眠时钟精度 SCA</td>\n<td>典型 20–500 ppm</td>\n<td>决定窗口加宽速度与长连接退化程度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>channel map</td>\n<td>好信道 ≥ 2</td>\n<td>坏信道过多会降低跳频质量与成功率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结-把空口账算清再谈优化\">小结：把空口账算清再谈优化</h2><p>理清 PHY 与链路层之后，一线排查和容量规划都变得可推导：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>信道账</strong>：40 个 2 MHz 信道 = 3 广播 + 37 数据，广播信道刻意避开 Wi-Fi 主信道。channel map 必须随现场射频环境动态重算。</li>\n<li><strong>跳频账</strong>：BLE 5.0+ 默认 CSA#2（异或折叠 + 乘 17 置换），4.x 回落 CSA#1。跳频序列不可由应用指定，能干预的只有 channel map。</li>\n<li><strong>时隙账</strong>：连接间隔 7.5 ms–4 s，往返固定 T_IFS 150 µs；单包空口时间可用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{1M}(L)=(10+L)\\times 8\\ \\mu s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{2M}(L)=(11+L)\\times 4\\ \\mu s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">11</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 估算。</li>\n<li><strong>吞吐账</strong>：默认 MTU 23 字节时净吞吐常只有 100–250 kbps；协商大 MTU + DLE + 2M PHY 后可接近 1 Mbps 量级。</li>\n<li><strong>稳定性账</strong>：睡眠时钟精度决定窗口加宽速度，是长连接性能退化的物理根因。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本 hub 后续章节会走到设备发现与配对绑定、可靠传输与后台连接、NFC/UWB 与量产运维。这些参数是所有上层策略的约束边界——任何 GATT 层的&quot;优化&quot;最终都要落回本节这几笔空口账。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"BLE 物理层与链路层：信道划分、跳频与空口时隙建模","id":"ble-物理层与链路层-信道划分-跳频与空口时隙建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从 2.4 GHz 空口到一条连接的时间轴","id":"核心概念-从-2-4-ghz-空口到一条连接的时间轴"},{"level":2,"text":"信道划分：3 个广播信道与 37 个数据信道","id":"信道划分-3-个广播信道与-37-个数据信道"},{"level":2,"text":"跳频与信道选择算法：CSA#1 与 CSA#2","id":"跳频与信道选择算法-csa-1-与-csa-2"},{"level":2,"text":"空口时隙建模：连接事件、窗口与吞吐上限","id":"空口时隙建模-连接事件-窗口与吞吐上限"},{"level":2,"text":"小结：把空口账算清再谈优化","id":"小结-把空口账算清再谈优化"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"GATT 数据模型：服务、特征、描述符与属性权限的工程建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-ble-bluetooth-nfc-connectivity-engineering/ble-stack-gatt-data-model/gatt-service-characteristic-descriptor-model"}}